.\" sample.1: a man page using the man macros
.TH SAMPLE 1 "2026-11-09" "mu 0.7.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sample \- show a page of text
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sample
[\fB\-v\fR]
[\fB\-w\fR \fIwidth\fR]
.IR file ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sample
prints each
.I file
to standard output, with \(lqcurly quotes\(rq and an em\(emdash.
.PP
A second paragraph that is long enough to wrap onto another line at sixty columns.
.SS Options
.TP
.B \-v
Print more.
.TP
.BI \-w " width"
Wrap at
.I width
columns.

The default is 80.
.IP \(bu 2
A bullet.
.IP \(bu
Another bullet.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
sample -w 40 notes.txt | less
.EE
.RS
Indented note.
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR cat (1),
.UR https://example.org/sample
the sample site
.UE .
